            <div class="flow-detail" data-transformer-flow-panels>
              <div data-panel="0">
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 1</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="輸入句子先被切成 tokens" data-en="The sentence becomes tokens">The sentence becomes tokens</p>
                <p class="article-p mb-0"
                   data-zh="例子是「我 愛 貓」。模型看到的不是一句完整文字，而是一串 token。後面所有矩陣運算都沿著這串 token 展開。"
                   data-en="The example is 我 愛 貓. The model sees a token sequence, and every matrix operation that follows is arranged around that sequence.">The example is 我 愛 貓. The model sees a token sequence, and every matrix operation that follows is arranged around that sequence.</p>
              </div>
              <div data-panel="1" hidden>
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 2</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="Embedding 加上位置資訊" data-en="Embedding adds position">Embedding adds position</p>
                <p class="article-p mb-0"
                   data-zh="每個 token 先變成 512 維向量，再加上 Positional Encoding。這一步讓模型同時知道「這個詞是什麼」以及「它在第幾個位置」。"
                   data-en="Each token becomes a 512 dimensional vector, then Positional Encoding is added. This tells the model both what the token is and where it appears.">Each token becomes a 512 dimensional vector, then Positional Encoding is added. This tells the model both what the token is and where it appears.</p>
              </div>
              <div data-panel="2" hidden>
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 3</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="Encoder 產生整句記憶" data-en="Encoder creates sentence memory">Encoder creates sentence memory</p>
                <p class="article-p mb-0"
                   data-zh="Encoder 透過 Self-Attention 和 FFN 反覆整合整句上下文。輸出仍是 3 x 512，但每一列都已經帶有全句資訊。"
                   data-en="The Encoder repeatedly combines full-sentence context through Self-Attention and FFN. The output is still 3 x 512, with each row carrying sentence-level information.">The Encoder repeatedly combines full-sentence context through Self-Attention and FFN. The output is still 3 x 512, with each row carrying sentence-level information.</p>
              </div>
              <div data-panel="3" hidden>
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 4</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="Decoder 一邊看歷史，一邊讀 Encoder" data-en="Decoder reads history and Encoder memory">Decoder reads history and Encoder memory</p>
                <p class="article-p mb-0"
                   data-zh="Decoder 先用 Masked Self-Attention 只看已生成的 token，再用 Cross-Attention 讀 Encoder 記憶。這就是翻譯時能對齊原句的關鍵。"
                   data-en="The Decoder first uses Masked Self-Attention to read generated tokens, then Cross-Attention to read Encoder memory. This is the key link that lets translation align with the source sentence.">The Decoder first uses Masked Self-Attention to read generated tokens, then Cross-Attention to read Encoder memory. This is the key link that lets translation align with the source sentence.</p>
              </div>
              <div data-panel="4" hidden>
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 5</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="Linear + Softmax 選出下一個 token" data-en="Linear + Softmax picks the next token">Linear + Softmax picks the next token</p>
                <p class="article-p mb-0"
                   data-zh="Decoder 最後位置的向量會被投影成詞彙表大小的分數，Softmax 再把分數轉成機率。機率最高的 token 會成為下一個輸出。"
                   data-en="The vector at the final Decoder position is projected into vocabulary-sized scores, then Softmax turns the scores into probabilities. The highest-probability token becomes the next output.">The vector at the final Decoder position is projected into vocabulary-sized scores, then Softmax turns the scores into probabilities. The highest-probability token becomes the next output.</p>
              </div>
              <div data-panel="5" hidden>
                <p class="flow-detail-kicker">STEP 6</p>
                <p class="article-h3" data-zh="新 token 餵回 Decoder，直到 &lt;EOS&gt;" data-en="Feed the token back until &lt;EOS&gt;">Feed the token back until &lt;EOS&gt;</p>
