                   data-en="If the output is not &lt;EOS&gt;, the token is appended to the generated history and the Decoder runs again. The translation grows one loop at a time.">If the output is not &lt;EOS&gt;, the token is appended to the generated history and the Decoder runs again. The translation grows one loop at a time.</p>
              </div>
